# Environment files.
#
# The real values live in the private `sigvault-secrets` repo
# (projects/desktop/*.env) and reach CI as the ENV_VARS_DESKTOP secret.
# Nothing under .env* is ever committed here. `.ee.desktop` IS committed —
# it is the schema, not a value sheet.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

